// transientYieldIndexParkingBand / steady: the same desk read by the kernel that
// has no latch and no memory.
//
// 5.56 put its eleven Bingham starts through the steady kernel and got one blind
// guess -- every row pays zero and the undetermined node sits at the average of
// the two fixed pressures, which happens to be the CENTRE of the band. This file
// asks the same question of the three Herschel-Bulkley walls of case_5 / case_1 /
// case_2: the steady kernel has no initial value to forget, so the only thing it
// can say about the band is what its threshold says, and the threshold is
// `4 tau_0 L / d` with no `n` and no `K` in it.
//
// Three cells, one per index, each two 8000 Pa walls in series across 10000 Pa --
// no steady flow exists for ANY of them, at ANY index or consistency, because
// 4 tau_0 L/d + 4 tau_0 L/d = 16000 > pA - pB. measured: the six rows print `Q 0`
// with `dp 5000`, the three nodes print 25000 -- the band centre again, and the
// same number for n=0.5, n=1 and n=2 -- and the banner reads `iterations=0
// residual=0 (converged)`. The steady kernel gives one index-blind answer, just
// like the band itself; the eleven Bingham starts of 5.56 and these three
// Herschel-Bulkley laws all land on the same 25000 Pa.
//
// verified by tests/check_transient_yield_index_parking_band.py
// (ctest verify.transientYieldIndexParkingBand).

solver
{
    type steadyNetwork;
}

fluid
{
    rho 850; mu 0.1;
}

nodes
{
    A { pressure 3.0e4; }
    B { pressure 2.0e4; }

    T5 {}; T1 {}; T2 {};
}

pipes
{
    S5 { from A; to T5; length 20; diameter 0.02; flowIndex 0.5; consistency 1.0; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E5 { from T5; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02; flowIndex 0.5; consistency 1.0; yieldStress 2.0; }
    S1 { from A; to T1; length 20; diameter 0.02; flowIndex 1.0; consistency 0.1; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E1 { from T1; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02; flowIndex 1.0; consistency 0.1; yieldStress 2.0; }
    S2 { from A; to T2; length 20; diameter 0.02; flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
    E2 { from T2; to B; length 20; diameter 0.02; flowIndex 2.0; consistency 0.02; yieldStress 2.0; }
}
